# Real-LLM evidence. The opt-in llm_candidate_v0 path produces raw
# model traces and a JSON eval report that embeds raw draft excerpts;
# both are treated as raw evidence and must not ship in the public
# repo. Publish only redacted artifacts under
# traces/redacted/llm_adversarial/ and the assembled evidence pack at
# evidence_packs/financial_links_llm_v0/.
